OL,3,GNEWSANew bid to stub out smoking on
OL,4,Ahospital grounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS bosses in Nottingham are launching
OL,7,Fanother drive to tackle smoking on
OL,8,Fhospital grounds despite a ban being in
OL,9,Fplace since 2006.
OL,11,FNottingham University Hospitals NHS
OL,12,FTrust (NUH) has launched a survey to
OL,13,Fgather views on what more can be done
OL,14,Fto reduce smoking on the grounds of
OL,15,Fsites such as Queen's Medical Centre
OL,16,F(QMC), Nottingham City Hospital and
OL,17,FRopewalk House.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
