OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSANew bid to stub out smoking on
OL,4,Ahospital grounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe action comes following complaints
OL,7,Ffrom patients, staff and a fire in
OL,8,FJanuary caused by a discarded
OL,9,Fcigarette, where NHS bosses declared a
OL,10,Fmajor incident at the QMC.
OL,12,FHospital bosses are gathering views
OL,13,Funtil the end of October and could
OL,14,Fconsider measures such as stronger
OL,15,Fenforcement.
